

### get the filters of a specific list
GET https://localhost:8443/locations/filters/2048
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### get the filters of a specific list
GET https://localhost:8443/locations/filters/2085
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### generate csv for specific list with id 2085
GET https://localhost:8443/locations/csv/2085
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### generate csv for specific list with id 2085 where country is Brazil
GET https://localhost:8443/locations/csv/2085?country=Brazil
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### generate csv for specific list with id 2085 where country is Brazil and state is Pará and csv contains result values
GET https://localhost:8443/locations/csv/2085?country=Brazil&state=Pará&type=result
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### generate csv for specific list with id 2085 where country is Brazil and state is Pará and csv contains result values also add gadmid field and list_location_id
GET https://localhost:8443/locations/csv/2085?country=Brazil&state=Pará&type=result&combinedColumns=gadmid,list_location_id
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### Get list location Geojson
POST https://localhost:8443/locations/getListLocationGeometry
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "listTableName": "list-doesthisprocess2",
  "locationID": 16
}

