### webserver locations to list-processing microservice
POST https://localhost:8443/locations/process-list
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "listName": "llp gfw pro 205806022023",
  "list_id": 5465,
  "path": "s3://gfwpro-lpl-dev/4j6l9gkvvldsuhug7-input_cocoageneric_random_10.csv",
  "template_type": "investment",
  "startAnalysis": true,
  "processing_limit": 120000,
  "analysis_types": ["FCD", "ALERTS"]
}